# Build context of java/Dockerfile is java/. The Maven reactor needs the whole tree (poms, libs, services, apps, config, platform-parent,
# .mvn, mvnw), so only build outputs, IDE files and local junk are excluded: the context stays small and the cache keys stable.
# Keep dist/ (the prebuilt jar of --build-arg JAR_FROM=prebuilt) and tools/ (StripNatives.java) in the context.
**/target
**/.idea
**/*.iml
**/.vscode
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/node_modules
**/.local
**/*.hprof
**/hs_err_pid*
**/.env
**/.env.*
